      "body": "Down from ₹1,028, the current price target is an average from 32 analysts. New target price is 7.5% above last closing price of ₹887. Stock is down 7.3% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹13.47 for next year compared to ₹29.56 last year.",
