      "date": "2026-05-25T12:03:27.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹2.50 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹2.50. Ex-date: 13th August 2026 Payment date: 19th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.3%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (17% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (8% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 2.9% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 15% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
